---
description: Keep a lightweight task list in todo.md during implementation
alwaysApply: true
---

For multi-step implementation work, maintain `todo.md`.

Requirements:

- Break the work into concrete tasks.
- Keep exactly one task marked `in_progress`.
- Mark tasks `done` immediately after they are actually complete.
- Add follow-up tasks if new work is discovered.
- Do not mark a task done if the implementation is partial or validation failed.

Use this status format:

- [ ] pending task
- [~] in_progress task
- [x] done task
